# OwO *sweeps clutter under the rug* .gitignore: files git should never track! ^w^
# Python caches and build output, test caches, local evaluation results, a local virtualenv, and the web UI's
# node_modules (web/dist IS tracked: the VALOR VM serves it) *wags tail*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
.pytest_cache/
eval/results/
.venv/
web/node_modules/
